    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/53377faec9bd4e761743914c857a2c88.avif?t=1688042697\" /></div><br><br>A <strong>fantasy RPG</strong> with <strong>music based battles</strong>?!<br><br>Dive into <strong>a wonderful universe</strong> with strange creatures, ancient legends, and\u2026 <strong>magic</strong>!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/5b9704e0b03c54de89ef69a5ae163fd0.poster.avif?t=1688042697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/5b9704e0b03c54de89ef69a5ae163fd0.webm?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/5b9704e0b03c54de89ef69a5ae163fd0.mp4?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You'll play as a boy looking for his past who wants to <strong>help a young girl</strong> to change the fate of the world.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/ff40858176d8dd064cefab950cfc4876.poster.avif?t=1688042697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/ff40858176d8dd064cefab950cfc4876.webm?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/ff40858176d8dd064cefab950cfc4876.mp4?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Take control of your team</strong> to solve puzzles.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/57e3999387bcb304c2411993723ccacd.poster.avif?t=1688042697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/57e3999387bcb304c2411993723ccacd.webm?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/57e3999387bcb304c2411993723ccacd.mp4?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>And be ready to <strong>defeat terrible enemies</strong> with <strong>music based battles</strong>.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/761a19b0e038cf7d43649ae0085e1e68.poster.avif?t=1688042697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/761a19b0e038cf7d43649ae0085e1e68.webm?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/761a19b0e038cf7d43649ae0085e1e68.mp4?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Music</strong> is not just a simple background. <strong>The rhythm will be your ally</strong> and you will have to work together to win your fights!<br><br>Ready? :)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/fd804254dcb7981d13da167b037fe150.poster.avif?t=1688042697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/fd804254dcb7981d13da167b037fe150.webm?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/fd804254dcb7981d13da167b037fe150.mp4?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/53377faec9bd4e761743914c857a2c88.avif?t=1688042697\" /></div><br><br>A <strong>fantasy RPG</strong> with <strong>music based battles</strong>?!<br><br>Dive into <strong>a wonderful universe</strong> with strange creatures, ancient legends, and\u2026 <strong>magic</strong>!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/5b9704e0b03c54de89ef69a5ae163fd0.poster.avif?t=1688042697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/5b9704e0b03c54de89ef69a5ae163fd0.webm?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/5b9704e0b03c54de89ef69a5ae163fd0.mp4?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>You'll play as a boy looking for his past who wants to <strong>help a young girl</strong> to change the fate of the world.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/ff40858176d8dd064cefab950cfc4876.poster.avif?t=1688042697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/ff40858176d8dd064cefab950cfc4876.webm?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/ff40858176d8dd064cefab950cfc4876.mp4?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Take control of your team</strong> to solve puzzles.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/57e3999387bcb304c2411993723ccacd.poster.avif?t=1688042697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/57e3999387bcb304c2411993723ccacd.webm?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/57e3999387bcb304c2411993723ccacd.mp4?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>And be ready to <strong>defeat terrible enemies</strong> with <strong>music based battles</strong>.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/761a19b0e038cf7d43649ae0085e1e68.poster.avif?t=1688042697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/761a19b0e038cf7d43649ae0085e1e68.webm?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/761a19b0e038cf7d43649ae0085e1e68.mp4?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Music</strong> is not just a simple background. <strong>The rhythm will be your ally</strong> and you will have to work together to win your fights!<br><br>Ready? :)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/fd804254dcb7981d13da167b037fe150.poster.avif?t=1688042697\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/fd804254dcb7981d13da167b037fe150.webm?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1745190/extras/fd804254dcb7981d13da167b037fe150.mp4?t=1688042697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
